1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:06,267
Merchants and Marine Bancorp's
third quarter: the deal lifted revenue,
but costs rose faster.

2
00:00:06,817 --> 00:00:11,362
Net income was one point four six
million dollars, up about three
percent.

3
00:00:11,912 --> 00:00:16,328
Revenue rose thirty-seven percent
after buying Farmers-Merchants
Bank.

4
00:00:16,878 --> 00:00:22,244
But expenses rose forty-one percent,
the highest cost ratio of four Gulf
South banks.

5
00:00:22,794 --> 00:00:26,319
And past-due loans climbed to two
and a half percent of loans.

6
00:00:26,869 --> 00:00:29,648
A bigger bank, not yet a more
profitable one.

